<title>NETHERLANDS: ARTU FULL-YEAR NET DOWN, SEES IMPROVEMENT.</title>
<headline>ARTU FULL-YEAR NET DOWN, SEES IMPROVEMENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1995/96 to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.17 vs   0.28</p>
<p>    Turnover				 9.89 vs   9.33</p>
<p>Note - Anti-allergy medicines maker Artu Biologicals NV said</p>
<p>it expected a significant improvement in profitability, thanks</p>
<p>to a new production facility and improved exports.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
